{
  "info": {
    "name": "User Auth API",
    "description": "Complete collection for testing the two-tier authentication system.\n\n## Architecture\n- **L1 Gateway** (port 8080) — thin proxy, forwards requests to L2\n- **L1 Shipment Service** (port 8082) — standalone microservice with local JWT validation\n- **L2 Auth Service** (port 8081) — internal auth + business logic\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. The `baseUrl` variable defaults to `http://localhost:8080`\n3. Use **Get Access Token** first, then run protected endpoints\n4. The `accessToken` variable is auto-saved via the Tests script",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "user-auth"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "shipmentUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8082",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "l2Url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8081",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "clientId",
      "value": "external_partner_001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "clientSecret",
      "value": "secret123",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "awb",
      "value": "AWB12345",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "shipmentId",
      "value": "SHP-001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "invoiceId",
      "value": "INV-001",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "Token issuance, refresh, and revocation endpoints.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', jsonData.refreshToken);",
                  "console.log('Token saved:', jsonData.accessToken?.substring(0, 50) + '...');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"grantType\": \"client_credentials\",\n    \"clientId\": \"{{clientId}}\",\n    \"clientSecret\": \"{{clientSecret}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/token",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Obtain a JWT access token using client credentials grant.\n\n**Response includes:**\n- `accessToken` — RS256-signed JWT (15 min expiry)\n- `refreshToken` — opaque token for renewing (7 day expiry)\n- `scope` — space-separated list of granted scopes"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', jsonData.refreshToken);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Exchange a refresh token for a new access + refresh token pair.\n\nThe old refresh token is invalidated (rotation)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Revoke the current access token. Token is added to a Redis revocation set."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "L1 Gateway Proxy APIs",
      "description": "Business APIs proxied through the L1 gateway to L2. Token is forwarded for server-side validation.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Tracking",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tracking/{{awb}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["tracking", "{{awb}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get tracking information for an airway bill.\n\n**Required scope:** `tracking:read`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Shipment (L1 Proxy)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"origin\": \"Warehouse A\",\n    \"destination\": \"Distribution Center B\",\n    \"description\": \"Electronics shipment\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/shipment",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["shipment"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new shipment via the L1 proxy.\nToken is forwarded to L2 for validation.\n\n**Required scope:** `shipment:create`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Shipment",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"status\": \"IN_TRANSIT\",\n    \"location\": \"Sorting Hub\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/shipment/{{shipmentId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["shipment", "{{shipmentId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Update an existing shipment.\n\n**Required scope:** `shipment:update`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"currentStatus\": \"PENDING\",\n    \"newStatus\": \"IN_TRANSIT\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/status/update",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["status", "update"]
            },
            "description": "Update status of a shipment or process.\n\n**Required scope:** `status:update`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Invoice",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/invoice/{{invoiceId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["invoice", "{{invoiceId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get invoice details.\n\n**Required scope:** `invoice:read`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "L1 Shipment Service (Local JWT Validation)",
      "description": "Standalone shipment microservice that validates the JWT itself (signature + expiry) and checks revocation via L2.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Shipment (Local Validation)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"origin\": \"Port of Shanghai\",\n    \"destination\": \"Port of Los Angeles\",\n    \"description\": \"Container shipment — electronics\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{shipmentUrl}}/shipment",
              "host": ["{{shipmentUrl}}"],
              "path": ["shipment"]
            },
            "description": "Create shipment via the standalone `l1-shipment-service`.\n\n**Token validation flow:**\n1. JWT signature + expiry — **validated locally** (RS256 public key)\n2. Required scope (`shipment:create`) — **checked from JWT claims**\n3. Revocation — calls `L2 /internal/auth/check-revocation`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "L2 Internal (Direct Access)",
      "description": "Direct access to L2 internal endpoints. Useful for debugging and manual testing.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Issue Token (Direct)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"clientId\": \"{{clientId}}\",\n    \"clientSecret\": \"{{clientSecret}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{l2Url}}/internal/auth/token",
              "host": ["{{l2Url}}"],
              "path": ["internal", "auth", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Direct token issuance from L2 (bypasses L1 proxy)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Check Token Revocation",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{l2Url}}/internal/auth/check-revocation?jti=REPLACE_WITH_JTI",
              "host": ["{{l2Url}}"],
              "path": ["internal", "auth", "check-revocation"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "jti", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_JTI" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Check if a specific JTI (JWT ID) has been revoked.\n\nExtract the `jti` from the JWT payload (the `jti` claim)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{l2Url}}/internal/health",
              "host": ["{{l2Url}}"],
              "path": ["internal", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Basic health check for L2."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Error Scenarios",
      "description": "Test cases for error handling.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Missing Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tracking/{{awb}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["tracking", "{{awb}}"]
            },
            "description": "Call a protected endpoint without any Authorization header.\n\n**Expected:** 401 Unauthorized"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Invalid Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer invalid.jwt.here" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tracking/{{awb}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["tracking", "{{awb}}"]
            },
            "description": "Call a protected endpoint with a malformed JWT.\n\n**Expected:** 401 Unauthorized (`AUTH_TOKEN_INVALID`)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Expired Token (Insufficient Scope)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/invoice/{{invoiceId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["invoice", "{{invoiceId}}"]
            },
            "description": "The test client `external_partner_001` has scopes `tracking:read` and `shipment:create` but NOT `invoice:read`.\n\n**Expected:** 403 Forbidden (`AUTH_INSUFFICIENT_SCOPE`)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Wrong Client Credentials",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"grantType\": \"client_credentials\",\n    \"clientId\": \"{{clientId}}\",\n    \"clientSecret\": \"wrong-secret\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/token",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "token"]
            },
            "description": "**Expected:** 401 Unauthorized"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
